  "content": "<h1><strong>更多传送门</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组仅为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gateways-to-eternity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadows_of_Fire 的《永恒传送门》(Gateways to Eternity)</a>添加了更多的传送门。</p>\n<p>目前，它仅支持以下模组间的兼容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden's Nether Expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L-Enders Cataclysm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>但未来将添加更多。如果您希望为其他模组生物添加传送门，请留下评论，我很可能会为您添加。</p>\n<p>待添加内容：</p>\n<p>Iron's Spells and Spellbooks</p>\n<p>Alex's Caves</p>\n<p>Mowzie's Mobs</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9A3V52I.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果有需求，将会移植到其他版本。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
